{"quest_id": 4355, "name": "死霊たちの船", "description": "嵐で傷ついた船を発見した。\n骸骨の魔物たちが船を護るように\n立っているようだが……。\n中級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃8体）", "event": "死霊の船と提督の決意", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920048, "map_no": 3113, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 40, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 18, "level": 90, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アンデッド"], "hp": 1000, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 120, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 161, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098672, "master_id": 168, "global_id": 167, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 4, "level": 80, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アンデッド"], "hp": 3000, "attack": 600, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 600, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 220, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 181, "move_speed": 450.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.75, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098688, "master_id": 169, "global_id": 168, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 5, "level": 90, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アンデッド"], "hp": 800, "attack": 250, "base_hp": 800, "base_attack": 250, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_range": 120, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 111, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098656, "missile_id": 23, "missile": {"speed": 2.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 167, "global_id": 166, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 5, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1200, "attack": 280, "base_hp": 1200, "base_attack": 280, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 40, "attack_speed": 80, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 109, "move_speed": 2000.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097696, "race_id": 11, "master_id": 39, "global_id": 38, "spawn_sec": 50}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 3, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アンデッド"], "hp": 1500, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 1500, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 800, "attack_range": 10, "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 40, "attack_interval": 113, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2101952, "missile_id": 45, "master_id": 343, "global_id": 342, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 116}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "兵士", "text": "ご報告します。\n船ですが、魔物との戦いでかなり\n傷ついているようです。", "face": "le0969ae563c4"}, {"name": "兵士", "text": "それと、船の前には骸骨の魔物がいまして……。\nまるで船を守るように立っているんです。", "face": "le0969ae563c4"}, {"name": "リーンベル", "text": "……そうか。", "face": "u268"}, {"name": "リーンベル", "text": "一つ提案なのだが、王子たちが魔物を\n引きつけている隙に私がこっそりと\n船に乗り込む、というのはどうだ？", "face": "u268"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "そうですね。一直線に進むよりもその方が\n良いかもしれません。", "face": "la2a86fa1a45d"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "引きつけるのは任せてください。"}]}, {"trigger": "battle", "at_sec": 118, "lines": [{"name": "亡霊", "text": "敵兵発見。我、偵察任務に出撃します。", "face": "lb0a936db49ad"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "王子、あれを！\nあれは亡霊のようです……っ！", "face": "la2a86fa1a45d"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "実体を持たない亡霊相手では\n通常の武器は効きにくいです。\nご注意ください！", "face": "la2a86fa1a45d"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "亡霊", "text": "敵は、非常に強力……。撤退します……。", "face": "lb0a936db49ad"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "亡霊は倒すことができません……。\nなにか強い怨念が彼女たちを\nここに縛り付けているのでしょう。", "face": "la2a86fa1a45d"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "先に中に入った彼女が心配です。\n私たちも早く行きましょう。", "face": "la2a86fa1a45d"}]}], "active": true}